<title>UK: CLF Hypo sets 100 million mark five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>CLF Hypo sets 100 million mark five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Sal. Oppenheim jr &amp; Cie KGaA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CLF-HYPOTHEKENBANK BERLIN AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   SPREAD     FLAT	MATURITY    17.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 6M LIBOR  PAY DATE    17.SEP.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.0     FULL FEES   UNDISC</p>
<p> LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEFE 1996/01 EMISSION 444</p>
